# Generated artifacts live under a `generated/` directory so git, GitHub, ESLint, Prettier and
# tsconfig can name them by path instead of listing each one four times over.
#
# They are committed on purpose: the release candidate hash covers the playback runtime bundle, and
# the PoseNet model data has to be in the package for offline playback. But they are machine output.
# One regeneration rewrites 19,705 lines of minified bundle whose only real change is minifier
# identifier allocation, or a single 6.5 MB base64 literal on one line. Rendering that as a diff
# helps nobody reviewing the change that caused it.
#
# `linguist-generated=true` collapses them in GitHub diffs and drops them from the language stats.
# `-diff` stops git rendering them locally; `git diff --text` still shows the content when a
# regeneration genuinely needs inspecting.
**/generated/** linguist-generated=true -diff
